#: data/io.github.phase1geo.outliner.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Quickly create outlines and export them in a number of useful formats. "
"Outliner contains powerful features to quickly create, edit, navigate, and "
"search your outlines while using a clean interface to keep you focused on "
"your ideas."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.phase1geo.outliner.appdata.xml.in:16
